00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:06.280
So now the process bar itself just covers

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:08.450
a significant portion of the page.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:10.560
But now, what do I need to do in order

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.440
to actually make it smaller?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.360
I try to grab this and release this,

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.300
but it just doesn't do anything.

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:20.470
Now, I can try to grab all
these three at the same time,

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.920
but it's still not happening.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:24.480
Now, if I want to actually smaller it

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:27.885
this way, now it looks like this, right?

00:11:27.885 --> 00:11:30.030
But if I want to make this larger,

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.130
it looks like this.

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:33.720
I mean, you see, it's just a huge pain

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:35.460
to work with these kind of elements,

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.621
I hope I convinced you by now,

00:11:37.621 --> 00:11:39.768
which is why, in professional contexts,

00:11:39.768 --> 00:11:41.620
they're just not being used.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:42.960
It's just extremely difficult

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:44.320
to get the results that you want,

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.780
and in most cases, you are much faster

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.433
in order to create designs
like that by yourself.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:53.444
So let's try to replicate this page,

00:11:53.444 --> 00:11:56.040
just let you see how it actually works,

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.330
to give you the confidence that you

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:59.760
could do that much faster yourself,

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.460
without these kinds of Smart Arts.

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:06.060
So let's first, without
using the Smart Arts section,

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:09.790
create basic shapes, and now, we want

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.263
such a process icon like this.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:17.160
And now, let's format
it a bit in a basic way.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:21.060
We can even go for such a
template design like this,

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:22.670
and now, of course,
what you can do is just

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:26.250
copy it a couple of times,
and there's a little shortcut

